0,Afade language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Afade_language,"Afade is a member of the Biu-Mandara group of the Afro-Asiatic family of languages. It is related to the Cameroonian languages Mpade, Maslam, Malgbe, Mser, and Lagwan.",Afade,Afro-Asiatic
