4,"Afade Language (AAL) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/aal/,"Afade is a stable indigenous language of Nigeria and Cameroon. It belongs to the Afro-Asiatic language family. Direct evidence is lacking, but the language is thought to be used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.",Afade,Afro-Asiatic
